            "review_title": "Review at CHANG KANG KUNG ( Thiso Mall )",
            "review_text": "Soko37\nBudapest, Hungary21025 contributions\n1\nHealthy steam culinary\nSep 2023\nFirst time in restaurant when served only steam dishes. Steam veggie, fish, shrimps. Steaming for dish is from 2 to 7 minutes and you have hot delicates prepared on your table. You prepared your dip according your wish in self serving area and then you go. Rice congee is desert. Very healthy and tasty, recommended.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten September 22, 2023",
